Want to remove a beat you uploaded by mistake or simply want to refresh your catalog? Deleting a beat from your Beat22 account is simple. Follow the steps below:

### **Step-by-Step Guide**

#### **Step 1: Log into your Beat22 account**

Visit [www.beat22.com](https://www.beat22.com) and log in using your producer’s credentials.

![Visit www.beat22.com and log in using your producer’s credentials.](/images/2025/06/Screenshot-2025-06-30-205008.png)

#### **Step 2: Go to “My Beats”**

Once logged in, click your profile icon in the top-right corner and choose "My Beats" from the dropdown menu.

![Once logged in, click your profile icon in the top-right corner and choose "My Beats" from the dropdown menu.](/images/2025/06/Screenshot-2025-06-30-205058.png)

#### **Step 3: Locate the beat you want to delete**

Browse or search to find the specific beat you want to delete from your list.

#### **Step 4: Click the delete icon**

You’ll see a trash bin icon next to each beat. Click it for the beat you want to remove.

![You’ll see a trash bin icon next to each beat. Click it for the beat you want to remove.](/images/2025/06/Screenshot-2025-06-30-205112.png)

#### **Step 5: Confirm Deletion**

A confirmation popup will appear. Click "Yes" to remove the beat from your profile permanently.

![A confirmation popup will appear. Click "Yes" to remove the beat from your profile permanently.](/images/2025/06/Screenshot-2025-06-30-205127.png)

####  ***Important:*** Once deleted, the beat cannot be recovered. However, any licenses already sold will still remain valid.

### **FAQs**

**Q1. Can I recover a beat after deleting it?** No, once deleted, the beat is permanently removed from your profile. **Q2. What happens to buyers who purchased the beat before deletion?** Their licenses remain valid and downloadable as per the license agreement. **Q3. I don’t see a delete option. What should I do?** Please email us at **support@beat22.com** with your Beat ID and title. Our team will assist you. Need more help? **Contact us at support@beat22.com**, we’re here to help you manage your catalog smoothly!
